@startuml
|Advisor|
start
:Review student profile and available estimates;

if (Follow-up needed?) then (Yes)
  :Enter action type, note, assignee, and date;

  if (Link a prediction?) then (Yes)
    :Select a saved prediction;
  endif

  |System|
  :Save follow-up as Open;
  :Record creation in the audit log;

  while (Follow-up still active?) is (Yes)
    |Advisor|
    :Open the follow-up when an update is needed;
    :Add a note or request a status change;

    |System|
    if (Requested status transition invalid?) then (Yes)
      :Display error and retain current status;
    else (No)
      :Save update and record audit event;
    endif
  endwhile (No)

  :Retain the closed action in follow-up history;
else (No)
  |Advisor|
  :Finish reviewing the student profile;
endif

stop

legend bottom
Normal status progression: Open -> In progress -> Resolved -> Closed
endlegend
@enduml
